<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>연 on</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/categories/%EC%97%B0/</link><description>Recent content in 연 on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://younsoid.github.io/categories/%EC%97%B0/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>폐암 데이터 확인 (01~04)</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs17/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs17/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="폐암-데이터-확인-0104"&gt;&#10; 폐암 데이터 확인 (01~04)&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ed%8f%90%ec%95%94-%eb%8d%b0%ec%9d%b4%ed%84%b0-%ed%99%95%ec%9d%b8-0104"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-10-27&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;TCGA 폐암 데이터를 확인하는 01~04번 파일을 돌려봤다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="01_inventory"&gt;&#10; 01_inventory&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#01_inventory"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-plain" data-lang="plain"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; slides svs_ok embedded&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;cancer &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;LUAD 404 404 403&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;LUSC 347 347 347&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;LUAD는 이미지 404장, LUSC는 347장이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이미지 전처리를 (나름) 해서 exaonepath 1.0으로 임베딩해줬었는데 유효한 타일이 하나도 없는 파일이 하나 있어서 (&lt;code&gt;TCGA-44-7661-01Z-00-DX1&lt;/code&gt;) 1장 빼고 750장이 임베딩됐다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="02_cohort"&gt;&#10; 02_cohort&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#02_cohort"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-plain" data-lang="plain"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; slides included tss no_fold&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;cancer&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;LUAD 404 403 33 0&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;LUSC 347 347 34 0&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;임베딩해놓은 750개는 LUAD 33개 기관, LUSC 34개 기관의 데이터이다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>